00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.120
It is willfully ignoring the story as it is told to you.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:07:00.400
This isn't always the case but here, for this movie, metaphorical is textual.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.780
But, you know, in order to fill out a video with what amounts to

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.800
