00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:09.100
requires the video creators to ignore a substantial portion of the text

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:13.300
in order to get to the ending, where they can hypothesize on the fate of the alien

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.000
and miss literally the entire point of the movie.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:19.520
VO 1: When in reality, it not only lives inside of Lena,

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.540
